# PROJECT: ProjectPulse AI
## AI-Powered Software Project Delay Prediction and Risk Intelligence Platform

Act as a senior Machine Learning Engineer, Full-Stack Developer, Data Scientist, Software Architect and UI/UX Designer.

Build a complete, functional, professional and interactive machine learning-based web application called **ProjectPulse AI – Software Project Delay Prediction and Risk Intelligence Platform**.

This is an academic mini-course project that must demonstrate the practical implementation and integration of multiple machine learning algorithms along with fundamental Software Engineering concepts.

The application should not look like a collection of separate ML experiments. It should function as one unified project intelligence platform where users can analyze software projects across different industries, development methodologies and project characteristics.

The application must have a polished interface, a well-structured machine learning pipeline, meaningful visualizations, explainable predictions and an interactive model comparison dashboard.

---

# 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

The primary objective is to analyze software development projects and predict:

1. Whether a project is likely to be delayed or completed on time.
2. The expected project completion duration.
3. The estimated number of delay days.
4. The probability of project delay.
5. The major factors contributing to potential delays.
6. The relationship between software development methodologies and project completion.
7. The performance of different machine learning algorithms on the same prediction problem.
8. Different project risk patterns using clustering techniques.

The system should help project managers understand project risks before they become serious problems.

The application must support multiple project domains instead of restricting analysis to one particular industry.

