## H. K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)

Implement KNN classification.

Predict project delay by comparing a new project with similar historical projects.

Use appropriate feature scaling.

Allow selection of different K values or demonstrate a suitable K selection process.

Display:
- Predicted class.
- Probability score.
- Nearest similar historical project records.
- Similarity or distance information.
